  "steps": [
    "Preheat. Oven to 400 °F.",
    "Sear. Heat oil in a Dutch oven; cook the chicken 2–3 minutes per side and remove.",
    "Aromatics. Add 4 tbsp butter and the onion; soften, then add garlic over low-medium heat so it doesn't burn.",
    "Sauce. Stir in the flour and cook it out 2–3 minutes. Pour in broth, seasonings and cream and bring to a simmer.",
    "Potatoes. Add the potatoes and simmer 10–15 minutes, then add the broccoli and chicken.",
    "Bake. Bake 20 minutes until the potatoes are fork tender and the chicken is cooked."
